This project adapts ideas and build-script structure from:
- Heeler (https://github.com/ZingerLittleBee/Heeler), Apache-2.0 —
  native/build.sh follows the approach of Packages/HeelerSSH/scripts/build-native.sh;
  the streamlocal-per-request transport follows Heeler ADR 0011.
- herdr (https://github.com/ogulcancelik/herdr), Apache-2.0 — the API schema copy in
  docs/reference/herdr-api.schema.json.

Linked at build time (built from source; licences copied to Packages/LassoSSH/Artifacts/Notices):
- OpenSSL — Apache-2.0
- libssh2 — BSD-3-Clause
